/id "q-277266" :question/id #uuid "dcd9d1cb-97cb-5348-9ebe-379bb3f90ffa" :question/math-academy-id "q-277266" :question/problem "Find the solution of ${x}^{2}-8x+12<0.$\n\n{{field-1}} $<x$\n{{field-2}}{{field-3}}" :question/worked-solution "To solve the inequality \n\n$$\n{x}^{2}-8x+12<0,\n$$\n\nwe need to find the values of $x$ for which the parabola \n\n$$\ny={x}^{2}-8x+12\n$$\n\nlies *below* the $x$-axis.\n\nFirst, let's find the roots of the parabola:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}-8x+12 & =0 \\\\ (x-6)(x-2) & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the roots are $x=2$ and $x=6,$ and we can graph the parabola as follows:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14004892/assets/d35f232f4a0ff7dc26238a1ac75ec8c2dc7216efa75f767dbbbac271b8a23a79.png)\n\nThe values marked in blue show all $x$-values where the parabola lies *below* the $x$-axis.\n\nSo, the solution to the inequality is $2<x<6.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-277266/field-1" "q-277266/field-2" "q-277266/field-3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "cbe80595-c807-506c-a356-566f1edb3402"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-277266"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-142315/selection/4ee35680e55ec140a2832102964c1d2e3a376aec99607575b25f17b522eb56aa" :answer/id #uuid "b968ab7c-8cc3-5428-9d0f-13fe3fab9342" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1\\le x\\le 5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-142315/selection/a04751d672e59b2b0f132009db18b8f39684814f65fcdba1f069d2a2110bf049" :answer/id #uuid "2781de1f-167c-5b66-afb0-cc59a101e459" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$x\\le 1$ or $x\\ge 5$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-142315/selection/d90f8cd2dee2245d6474f9e41e9a88ea19df4478c9c8776357d34a9c38ebc48d" :answer/id #uuid "dcb2bf41-1b26-552a-a9ff-495c9b6f3050" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-5\\le x\\le -1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "